# after a restart; control lone monument) and SQ-PSM-07 (lone monument guardians). Vars S5SM, S5LM from s5_B.qb.
pace 2

## S5B2-00 | setup (not a queue row)
bootexpect Done \(
> time set noon
> difficulty normal
> scoreboard objectives add s5n dummy
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player))

## SQ-PSM-06 | struck monument after a restart: 3 elder guardians, rooms, spawn_overrides box
> forceload add {S5SM1-48} {S5SM3-48} {S5SM1+48} {S5SM3+48}
> pbot spawn s5mstruck {S5SM1} 60 {S5SM3} minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 20
> execute store result score #struck_elders s5n positioned {S5SM1} 50 {S5SM3} if entity @e[type=minecraft:elder_guardian,distance=..48]
> scoreboard players get #struck_elders s5n
> cespawnbox {S5SM1} 50 {S5SM3}
> cespawnbox {S5SM1} 45 {S5SM3+8}
sleep 2
> zq count {S5SM1-20} 39 {S5SM3-20} {S5SM1+20} 62 {S5SM3+20} minecraft:prismarine_bricks
> say PSM06 struck counted
waitlog PSM06 struck counted 180
expect #struck_elders has 3 \[s5n\]
reject could not be rebuilt
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player))
expect \[spawn-boxes\] .*box spawn_overrides of creativeengineering:meta/struck_monument, part minecraft:monument -> \[minecraft:guardian 1 \(2-4\)\]
look prismarine brick count well above 0 = interior rooms present (compare with the lone monument's count in SQ-PSM-06b)
> pbot remove s5mstruck

