## SQ-PSM-07 | lone monument: guardians respawn within 240 s
> forceload add {S5LM1-48} {S5LM3-48} {S5LM1+48} {S5LM3+48}
> execute positioned {S5LM1} 50 {S5LM3} run kill @e[type=minecraft:guardian,distance=..64]
> setblock {S5LM1} 66 {S5LM3} minecraft:glass
> pbot spawn s5gd {S5LM1} 67 {S5LM3} minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 240
> execute store result score #guardians s5n positioned {S5LM1} 50 {S5LM3} if entity @e[type=minecraft:guardian,distance=..30]
> scoreboard players get #guardians s5n
> ceperf mobcap
sleep 2
> pbot remove s5gd
expect #guardians has [1-9]\d* \[s5n\]
